{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund the procurement & delivery of insulin and diabetes supplies to Gaza",
        "additional_details": "Insulin and diabetes supplies are not consistently available in Gaza due to disrupted supply routes and limited healthcare infrastructure. Even when supplies arrive, there may not be enough and may not always be able to be stored or distributed safely, putting people with diabetes at serious risk.",
        "background": "We are asking the UK Government to fund the procurement and delivery of insulin and diabetes supplies to Gaza without interruption, as insulin is a life-saving medicine for people with diabetes.",
